(14, 'Mini Humanoid Making Project', 'Are you fascinated by robotics and eager to contribute to cutting-edge technology? Join our Mini Humanoid Making Project, where innovation meets creativity in the realm of robotics. This project aims to design and build miniature humanoid robots capable of various tasks and interactions.\r\n\r\nProject Overview:\r\n\r\nObjective: Develop miniature humanoid robots that can perform tasks autonomously.\r\nSkills Development: Gain hands-on experience in robotics, programming, and mechanical engineering.\r\nCollaborative Environment: Work alongside experts and enthusiasts passionate about robotics.\r\nLearning Opportunities: Expand your knowledge of artificial intelligence, sensors, and human-robot interactions.\r\nRoles Available:\r\n\r\nMechanical Engineers: Design and fabricate robot components and structures.\r\nSoftware Developers: Program robot functionalities and behaviors.\r\nElectronics Specialists: Integrate sensors and actuators for enhanced robot capabilities.\r\nProject Managers: Coordinate tasks, timelines, and team efforts.\r\nApply Now:\r\nIf you\'re excited about pushing the boundaries of robotics and eager to contribute your skills, we invite you to join our team. Send your application to [your email] with your resume and a brief statement of interest.\r\n\r\nDon\'t miss this opportunity to be part of a groundbreaking project that explores the future of robotics!\r\n\r\nJoin us in pedaling towards a greener and healthier future!', , 5, 0, 15, NULL, 0, 0, 'Nellore', 'thiruorg@gmail.com');

